{"excerpt_id": "ex_c5986bb2facc61b2", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-gnn-001-a", "start": 0, "end": 59, "text": "The paper reports a random 80/10/10 split of the molecules.", "text_sha256": "69233c395f723472130cc6f3d3e9372cf9e0ee3540d4c22edafdc30578d3a560", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=gnn-001&noteId=rev-gnn-001-a", "source_sha256": "30481b833a1e331a6554ed2794186bfba3ecf7016b70678d8d491e1d99e08326"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_110f92f3599151f1", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-gnn-001-a", "start": 60, "end": 182, "text": "Random splits are known to leak near-duplicate scaffolds between train and test, so the reported MAE is likely optimistic.", "text_sha256": "4aea7ef6bff915efa676fbe4652683a4df59abcb9199c8c97931438b8add115d", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=gnn-001&noteId=rev-gnn-001-a", "source_sha256": "30481b833a1e331a6554ed2794186bfba3ecf7016b70678d8d491e1d99e08326"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_845f5eb5621099f5", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-gnn-002-a", "start": 0, "end": 67, "text": "The pretraining corpus overlaps with the downstream test molecules.", "text_sha256": "7217f5f5452140e190ca9dc38c9aac1985075b2ba43c857d2affed4e77ee0991", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=gnn-002&noteId=rev-gnn-002-a", "source_sha256": "523ccc30305f67955b24a23f860c5e3699137cf12aff88416b5a6c1511bec9bb"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_ca5fa760fdb45841", "source_kind": "decision", "source_id": "dec-gnn-001", "start": 25, "end": 71, "text": "the random split likely overstates performance", "text_sha256": "b1188787a3179b6328c37c24b4e2f13b5d7e64a2ef17b85d7c12321c419aa734", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=gnn-001&noteId=dec-gnn-001", "source_sha256": "8d50f325e4ad8e39417cc04147d3ee27c45d8fd1be7c97d5ecd98aaf6807c80a"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_a2237bdefb099544", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-seg-001-a", "start": 0, "end": 75, "text": "Slices from the same patient appear in both the training and the test sets.", "text_sha256": "b58c759be9140ce6f6e6a61949feb792d90ea86a37ff9081a4a2c6e7f2b090dd", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=seg-001&noteId=rev-seg-001-a", "source_sha256": "49bad793a21e94f4930c570256650e9ffb3bdd5dee16e01cac175ed7db217a9a"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_5c81d63b4fea533c", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-seg-002-a", "start": 0, "end": 57, "text": "The target-site images are used to select the checkpoint.", "text_sha256": "3442994652c85dc171186b69f4204968e6bfc8fbade6e5bacc2749f77bb0a3bb", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=seg-002&noteId=rev-seg-002-a", "source_sha256": "9b049365256c41a9666e981e375c3674cba8950db9288709b1fdfa98d9a4a505"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_e16251d95837eb1b", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-seg-003-b", "start": 125, "end": 243, "text": "Several frames come from the same video, so frame-level random splitting may leak near-identical images across splits.", "text_sha256": "186b1263d733469e2ef5b8d7c4dee89ba9ba08cd2c3f3a22e52e2d67215833bf", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=seg-003&noteId=rev-seg-003-b", "source_sha256": "79ff9fc2e311058b2ee985282f7dcaf8ad6fb4301d9eccc5d9d83ed197142857"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_fc88c26e0b31af5e", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-gnn-001-b", "start": 0, "end": 65, "text": "All numbers come from a single training run with one random seed.", "text_sha256": "0d7b5472269009086dc50a604e98a22d476ff659b5eed7cd74c744ac15299f00", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=gnn-001&noteId=rev-gnn-001-b", "source_sha256": "d36b1f9452c00bdcf6ee593f13c589c6602bfd52d498b2adce2db97c7bf25bdd"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_4b76d98627bb3f0c", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-gnn-001-b", "start": 66, "end": 158, "text": "Without error bars across seeds it is impossible to tell whether the 3% improvement is real.", "text_sha256": "9ad7066b7817f78221ab28aa4be425a7fc2ace2db305bfec0c30b2d61f68ac10", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=gnn-001&noteId=rev-gnn-001-b", "source_sha256": "d36b1f9452c00bdcf6ee593f13c589c6602bfd52d498b2adce2db97c7bf25bdd"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_6ec54fbcbb2ccae1", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-gnn-003-b", "start": 267, "end": 313, "text": "A single seed is used for every ensemble size.", "text_sha256": "8c8cbb924781e2a79cfcf6d8c43899ec1d56d3ccaf62d5818df4d5747dd4ab54", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=gnn-003&noteId=rev-gnn-003-b", "source_sha256": "f345f597ea99e2eaf41c13a718bb38c4305179ed218c681e42ade1ba53d9a28b"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_7686b8804b5212e3", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-seg-002-b", "start": 0, "end": 52, "text": "Results are reported from one run with a fixed seed.", "text_sha256": "78310efc1e22004b23f9d4d4f51dad3cf1ccb3749998d08dfb04dad99d129d5d", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=seg-002&noteId=rev-seg-002-b", "source_sha256": "90e5eddfad372178f6c629dd9128de3b77df5da55ee8c03251e9d0f595103dbd"}
{"excerpt_id": "ex_ffdc51c0fc1c1603", "source_kind": "review", "source_id": "rev-seg-001-b", "start": 69, "end": 135, "text": "No external validation on a different scanner or site is provided.", "text_sha256": "01959e2330456e259c58ed56622c927ccf9e70bc387a830b4d6e0e81a66f90ed", "source_url": "https://example.org/fake-venue/forum?id=seg-001&noteId=rev-seg-001-b", "source_sha256": "18ec6418c21fd9df56c4d20d77b47cfac210ec14df8ea3102e117a987d72364c"}
